## Step 1: mix

1. Stir flour and water until no dry flour is left

<step>
  <text anim=left>
    2. Rest for 30 minutes
  </text>
</step>

<step>
  <text anim=left>
    3. Add starter and salt, squeeze them in with wet hands
  </text>
</step>

<step>
  <text anim=pop>
    **Do not knead.** The folds do the work.
  </text>
</step>
